WEBVTT

00:06:28.361 --> 00:06:30.691
to interact and study together,

00:06:30.715 --> 00:06:35.754
and also to reduce the time
our professors need

00:06:35.778 --> 00:06:38.030
to labor over class assignments.

00:06:41.006 --> 00:06:46.208
If the Internet has made us
a global village,

00:06:46.232 --> 00:06:49.997
this model can develop
its future leadership.

00:06:50.378 --> 00:06:51.645
Look how we do it.

00:06:52.251 --> 00:06:55.055
We only offer two programs:

00:06:55.079 --> 00:06:57.752
business administration
and computer science,

00:06:57.776 --> 00:07:01.934
the two programs most in demand worldwide,